      "writtenOn": "2023-02-09T05:19:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIUC that means we\u0027ll accept an end doc without an end tag for the declaration tag as long as there is something in the place of a start tag (e.g. text). E.g. the following will be considered valid\n\n    \u003cnetwork-capabilities-declaration xmlns...\u003e\n    Some text\n\nBecause immediately after the start tag for declaration you\u0027ll find a TEXT node, which is !\u003d END_TAG, and then is !\u003d START_TAG, then is not \u003d\u003d END_DOCUMENT, so you next(), then you find END_DOCUMENT and you return.",
      "range": {
