tests/unit/res/xml/self_certified_capabilities_both.xml packages/modules/Connectivity/tests/unit/res/xml/self_certified_capabilities_latency.xml packages/modules/Connectivity/tests/unit/res/xml/self_certified_capabilities_other.xml packages/modules/Connectivity/tests/unit/res/xml/self_certified_capabilities_wrong_declaration.xml packages/modules/Connectivity/tests/unit/res/xml/self_certified_capabilities_wrong_tag.xml\nOutput:\npackages/modules/Connectivity/tests/unit/res/xml/self_certified_capabilities_bad_format.xml:18: error: no element found.\npackages/modules/Connectivity/tests/unit/res/xml/self_certified_capabilities_bad_format.xml: error: file failed to compile.\n\n```",
